WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:06.934 --> 00:00:10.867
Louis Leakey sent me to
Gombe because he believed that

00:00:10.867 --> 00:00:14.734
an understanding of chimpanzees
in the wild would help

00:00:14.734 --> 00:00:18.166
him to better guess
how our Stone-Age

00:00:18.166 --> 00:00:19.734
ancestors may have behaved.

00:00:33.066 --> 00:00:34.900
It had long been
thought that we were

00:00:34.900 --> 00:00:40.600
the only creatures on earth
that used and made tools.

00:00:40.600 --> 00:00:43.633
"Man the toolmaker" is
how we were defined.

00:00:46.600 --> 00:00:48.400
[music playing]

00:00:48.400 --> 00:00:52.667
And here was David
Greybeard using a tool.

00:01:00.367 --> 00:01:02.600
It was hard for me to
believe what I'd seen.

00:01:06.700 --> 00:01:11.367
A few days later, I watched,
spellbound, as chimps set off

00:01:11.367 --> 00:01:16.066
to a termite mound,
picked a small, leafy twig

00:01:16.066 --> 00:01:18.633
and stripped it of its leaves.

00:01:18.633 --> 00:01:21.834
That was object modification,
the crude beginning

00:01:21.834 --> 00:01:22.767
of tool making.

00:01:27.834 --> 00:01:29.734
It had never been seen before.

00:01:41.633 --> 00:01:44.500
When I telegrammed
the news to Louis,

00:01:44.500 --> 00:01:47.900
he responded that we
must now redefine man

00:01:47.900 --> 00:01:50.333
or accept chimpanzees as human.

00:01:54.433 --> 00:01:58.100
My observations at Gombe
challenged human uniqueness.

00:01:58.100 --> 00:02:01.467
And whenever that happens, there
is always a violent uproar.

00:02:04.767 --> 00:02:07.500
There were some who would try
to discredit my observations

00:02:07.500 --> 00:02:10.867
because I was a young,
untrained girl, who should

00:02:10.867 --> 00:02:14.400
therefore be disregarded.

00:02:14.400 --> 00:02:16.567
The result of it
all, however, is

00:02:16.567 --> 00:02:18.367
that Louis was able
to obtain a grant

00:02:18.367 --> 00:02:25.033
from the National Geographic
Society to continue my study.

00:02:25.033 --> 00:02:30.166
In addition, they would be
spending out a photographer

00:02:30.166 --> 00:02:33.300
to document the chimpanzees.

